+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing support distinguishes refund reviews from invoice questions through
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts`. The current implementation
+classifies a message containing the lowercase text `refund` as
+`refund-review`; every other message passed to it is classified as
+`invoice-question`.
+
+This classification routes the question only. It does not issue a refund,
+change an invoice, or establish that either action occurred. Support responses
+must preserve that boundary and rely on available evidence for any additional
+claim.

